WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
近期只有水准原点，一年测一次。开启下一期的条件是一个数，不是一个年份。
The near term is the origin benchmark alone, read once a year. What opens the next phase is a number, not a year.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
闭合差在限差以内：整条路线的每一站被承认，中期开启。
Closure within tolerance: every station on the route stands, and the mid term opens.

3
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
闭合差超限：整段作废重测，不允许挑一站修正了事。**什么也不开启。**
Closure over tolerance: the whole route is re-surveyed and no single station is patched. Nothing opens.

4
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
重测通过后，远期开启。进度由闭合结果决定，不由日期决定。
When the re-survey passes, the long term opens. Advanced by closure results, not by dates.
